<title>USA: Monterey Bay stake raised by Findim.</title>
<headline>Monterey Bay stake raised by Findim.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Findim Investments S.A., a Massagno, Switzerland,-based firm, said Friday it raised its stake in Monterey Bay Bancorp Inc to 6.98 percent or 226,500 common shares.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, Findim said it bought 43,000 additional shares of the banking company between November 27 and December 10 at prices ranging fromn $14.51 to $15.13 a share.</p>
</text>
